This is a complete, self-contained HTML file that recreates the classic 1978 Space Invaders arcade experience in your browser. It includes the iconic sprite designs, sound effects, and game mechanics.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Space Invaders · 1978 Taito</title>
  <style>
    /* Pixel-perfect CRT styling */
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      image-rendering: pixelated;
      image-rendering: crisp-edges;
    }
    body {
      background: #000;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    }
    .arcade-cabinet {
      background: #1a1a2e;
      padding: 20px 20px 30px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #0f0f1a, 0 0 20px #3a3a5c;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .crt-screen {
      background: #0a0a0a;
      border: 6px solid #222;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 10px;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px #000, 0 0 10px #2f2f4f;
      position: relative;
    }
    canvas {
      display: block;
      width: 600px;
      height: 750px;
      background: #0a0a0a;
      image-rendering: pixelated;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px #1a1a1a inset;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .controls {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 40px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      color: #eee;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      text-shadow: 0 0 6px #7f7fff;
      background: #111;
      padding: 10px 30px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      border: 2px solid #3a3a5c;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }
    .controls span {
      background: #222;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #7a7aff;
      color: #fff;
    }
    .btn-reset {
      background: #2a2a3a;
      border: 2px solid #7a7aff;
      color: #ddd;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      padding: 6px 18px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      cursor: pointer;
      margin-top: 12px;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-reset:hover {
      background: #3a3a5a;
      border-color: #aab;
    }
    .scanlines {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(
        0deg,
        rgba(0,0,0,0.15) 0px,
        rgba(0,0,0,0.15) 2px,
        transparent 2px,
        transparent 4px
      );
      pointer-events: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="arcade-cabinet">
  <div class="crt-screen" style="position:relative;">
    <canvas id="gameCanvas" width="600" height="750"></canvas>
